|-------|-------------|
| **Decision & Rationale** | What you decided and exactly why |
| **Timestamp** | Exact date and time |
| **Probabilistic Forecast** | Specific % probability (must satisfy: 1) objective outcome, 2) specific time period, 3) strict percentage) |
| **Physical/Emotional State** | Self-audit of stress, fatigue, emotional state |
| **Scenarios & Weights** | Multiple probabilistic outcome maps |
| **Lynchpin Premises** | The 2-3 assumptions everything depends on |
